      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautifully presented turnkey home offers style, comfort, and space in all the right places. The open, bright layout is enhanced by solid wooden floors, plush carpets, and high-end furniture and fixtures that elevate every room.\r\n\r\nThe apartment features two large bedrooms, each offering an abundance of built-in storage, with the master enjoying its own private en-suite. A sleek, well finished family bathroom serves the rest of the home.\r\n\r\nThe living space opens directly onto a south-facing balcony, capturing sunlight from morning to evening — perfect for relaxing, entertaining, or simply enjoying the brightness that defines this property.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from a large storage room, offering excellent additional space for seasonal items, sports equipment, or everyday household needs.\r\n\r\nA must see apartment for anyone seeking turnkey quality, premium finishes, and exceptional natural light."
      },
